load @term/seed/space/metric
  find metric-space

# A fractal: a shape with detail at every scale, self-similar so that zooming in reveals copies of the whole, with a
# fractional dimension that exceeds its topological one. The exponentially branching tree of the hyperbolic mesh and the
# Fibonacci tiling tree are fractal in flavor: the same pattern repeats shell after shell. The form carries the metric
# space the fractal sits in.
form fractal
  link space, like metric-space
